DSH WorkBuddy Connect README · ⚠️ Read this first: this plugin only works for me：- its behavior is bound to **your own app sign-in** — switching accounts is followed automatically;
- if someone else takes this code, it connects to **their** account, not mine;
- it runs a local loopback shim on a **random port** bound to `127.0.0.1`, serving only
  `/healthz`, `/v1/models`, and `/v1/chat/completions`, with no write endpoints.

So: **this repository is a public archive of my own setup, not a ready-to-use distribution.**
